  "summary": "The code suffered from poor performance due to nested array lookups and lacked necessary documentation. I have refactored the logic to use a Set for O(N) performance and added JSDoc with basic input validation to improve robustness.",
  "fixed_code": "/**\n * Extracts a unique list of tags from an array of post objects.\n * @param {{tags: string[]}[]} posts - Array of post objects containing tags.\n * @returns {string[]} A unique array of tags.\n */\nfunction uniqueTags(posts) {\n    if (!Array.isArray(posts)) return [];\n    return [...new Set(posts.flatMap(post => post.tags || []))];\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { uniqueTags };"
